The provided class is an internal RxJava subscriber that heavily depends on the surrounding RxJava infrastructure (e.g., `InnerQueuedSubscriberSupport`, `QueueSubscription`, `SimpleQueue`, and various concurrency utilities). Its behavior is tightly coupled with the reactive stream lifecycle and cannot be meaningfully benchmarked in isolation with JMH without substantial scaffolding. Consequently, a dedicated JMH benchmark is not appropriate for this piece of code.